  "title": "The Long Cut",
  "summary": "Topology-mancer:&ldquo;Why can&rsquo;t you understand that I cannot draw you a map?&rdquo;\n\nProgress-tracer: &ldquo;I don&rsquo;t request a detailed map, you only need to draw me a rough one, and then I can identify the paths myself.&rdquo;\n\nTopology-mancer: &ldquo;Isn&rsquo;t the world I live in built by you? All the connections, information portals, signal channels, cables, bricks, shortcuts, and encrypted pathways&mdash;this entire intricate digital palace was constructed with your hands. Why do you need me to draw you a map?&rdquo;\n\nProgress-tracer: &ldquo;Our blueprint has been invalidated already. We built this place based on it, but now that construction is finished, we&rsquo;re trapped inside&mdash;it&rsquo;s like how the ancient aristocrats buried the workers who built their tombs.&rdquo;\n\nTopology-mancer: &ldquo;You just mentioned you&rsquo;re &lsquo;trapped inside,&rsquo; so what&rsquo;s outside?&rdquo;\n\nProgress-tracer: &ldquo;A place similar to this, but not entirely habitable. I only started to memorize the details of that place since I became confined here. This place feels like a mirror image of the &lsquo;outside&rsquo;; perhaps the main difference lies in the density of time. Time here flows faster than my own blood&mdash;my skin overflows with it, and my mind is engulfed by its pulse signals&hellip; look at this place, how does it resemble the blueprint at all? There is no orientation, no coordinates, nothing like our crystal-clear plan!&rdquo;\n\nTopology-mancer: &ldquo;Poor man. But I still don&rsquo;t understand why I need to draw this map for you.&rdquo;\n\nProgress-tracer: &ldquo;You are not like us. You were born here, and are indigenous to this place. Although we came into existence before you, you&apos;re more geographically &lsquo;authentic&rsquo; than we are. Anyone who&rsquo;s seen the blueprint will be inscribed with a tremendous number of details of this place&rsquo;s alleys, pathways, and structures&mdash;we are human beings after all...",
